  "title": "Inferring consequences of action requires a model of past and future",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "370cf42c-4c15-4e99-8bdc-386c155ca6ab",
      "text": "The consequences of an action come after the action, so any model that infers those consequences must carry a temporal thickness: internal dynamics able to infer the past and predict the future.",
